{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/directions-under-the-building-act-1984-for-telecommunications-related-building-work-circular-022026","content_id":"a30aa96b-75a0-4181-b1df-2412f6f382be","description":"​​This circular draws attention to the publication of type relaxation directions for some telecommunications building work.​","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9382912","isbn":"","title":"Directions under the Building Act 1984 for telecommunications related building work, Circular 02/2026","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/directions-under-the-building-act-1984-for-telecommunications-related-building-work-circular-022026/directions-under-the-building-act-1984-for-telecommunications-related-building-work-circular-022026"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The purpose of this circular is to announce the type relaxation directions for the drilling of holes to install fibre optic cabling, and for building work to mobile masts.</p>\n\n<p>​These changes apply only to buildings and building work in England.​</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-09T09:44:29Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9382912"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-09T10:44:29.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-07-09T10:44:29+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/p